{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36353","headline":"侯郎中新置西湖 · 方干","name":"侯郎中新置西湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远近利民因智力，周回润物像心源。\n菰蒲纵感生成惠，鱣鲔那占广大恩。\n潋灩清辉吞半郭，萦纡别派入遥村。\n砂泉遶石通山脉，岸木黏萍是浪痕。\n已见澄来连镜底，兼知极处浸云根。\n波涛不起时方泰，舟檝徐行日易昏。\n烟雾未应藏岛屿，凫鷖亦解避旌旛。\n虽云桃叶歌还醉，却被荷花笑不言。\n孤鹤必应思凤诏，凡鱼岂合在龙门。\n能将盛事添元化，一夕机谟万古存。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36353.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36353","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}